sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as You
  participant UI as Web UI
  participant API as API
  participant L as Ollama
  participant G as Truthfulness guard
  participant P as Playwright (PDF)
  U->>UI: Click "Tailor for this job"
  UI->>API: POST /jobs/:id/documents
  API->>L: tailor prompt (profile bullets with IDs + JD)
  L-->>API: TailoredResume JSON
  API->>G: verify skills, numbers, technologies, bullet IDs
  alt violations found
    G-->>API: report
    API->>L: regenerate with violation list
    L-->>API: corrected JSON
    API->>G: verify again
  end
  G-->>API: ok + guardReport
  API->>L: cover letter prompt
  L-->>API: CoverLetter JSON
  API-->>UI: draft + diff vs base resume
  U->>UI: Edit, then Approve
  UI->>API: POST /documents/:id/approve
  API->>P: HTML to PDF
  P-->>API: file path
  API-->>UI: download links
